#: blocks/feedback-form/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Feedback Form"
msgstr "Feedbackformulär"

#: blocks/feedback-form/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "A 'send us feedback' form that emails the club and stores submissions."
msgstr "Ett formulär där besökare kan ge oss feedback. Svaren mejlas till klubben och sparas."

#: blocks/footer-nav/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Footer Navigation"
msgstr "Sidfotsnavigering"

#: blocks/footer-nav/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Renders the footer links and text configured under Appearance → Rockaden."
msgstr "Visar sidfotens länkar och text från Utseende → Rockaden."

#: blocks/latest-news/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Latest News"
msgstr "Senaste nyheterna"

#: blocks/latest-news/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Displays the latest news posts as cards with a link to the full archive."
msgstr "Visar de senaste nyheterna som kort, med en länk till hela arkivet."

#: blocks/membership-form/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Membership Form"
msgstr "Medlemsformulär"

#: blocks/membership-form/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A form for asking to join the club, or to leave it. Each submission is "
"stored as a request for an editor to handle and emailed to the club."
msgstr "Ett formulär för att ansöka om medlemskap eller begära utträde. Varje inskick sparas som en förfrågan som en redaktör hanterar, och mejlas till klubben."

#: blocks/page-title/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Page Title (Conditional)"
msgstr "Sidrubrik (villkorlig)"

#: blocks/page-title/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Renders the page title unless hidden via per-page setting."
msgstr "Visar sidans rubrik, om den inte är dold med inställningen på sidan."

#: blocks/reactions/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Reactions"
msgstr "Reaktioner"

#: blocks/reactions/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Lets readers react to a news post with an emoji. Which emoji are offered is "
"set under Appearance → Rockaden."
msgstr "Låter läsare reagera på en nyhet med en emoji. Vilka emojier som finns ställs in under Utseende → Rockaden."

#: blocks/section-nav/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Section Navigation"
msgstr "Sektionsnavigering"

#: blocks/section-nav/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Auto-generates sidebar navigation from page hierarchy (parent + children)."
msgstr "Skapar navigering i sidofältet automatiskt från sidhierarkin (huvudsida och undersidor)."

#: blocks/shop-grid/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Shop Items"
msgstr "Schackmateriel"

#: blocks/shop-grid/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Displays shop items (chess equipment for sale)."
msgstr "Visar klubbens schackmateriel till försäljning."

#: blocks/sidebar-card/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Sidebar Card"
msgstr "Sidofältskort"

#: blocks/sidebar-card/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"One sidebar panel: a short text with an optional button, or a linked image. "
"Used inside a Sidebar block."
msgstr "En panel i sidofältet: en kort text med en valfri knapp, eller en länkad bild. Används i ett Sidofält-block."

#: blocks/sidebar-panel/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Sidebar Panel"
msgstr "Sidofältspanel"

#: blocks/sidebar-panel/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Sidebar cards configured under Appearance → Rockaden. Insert anywhere on a "
"page; on templated pages (index.html, page.html) it's gated by the per-page "
"\"Show sidebar\" checkbox."
msgstr "Sidofältskort som ställs in under Utseende → Rockaden. Kan läggas var som helst på en sida; på sidor som använder en mall (index.html, page.html) styrs det av kryssrutan ”Visa sidofält” på sidan."

#: blocks/sidebar/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Sidebar"
msgstr "Sidofält"

#: blocks/sidebar/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A column of sidebar cards with their own content. Add one Sidebar Card per "
"panel."
msgstr "En kolumn med sidofältskort med eget innehåll. Lägg till ett Sidofältskort per panel."

